@startuml
title Online schema change: target high-level lifecycle

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #E8F1FA
  BorderColor #315B7D
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FFF2CC
  DiamondBorderColor #8A6D1D
}

start
:Submit DDL and durably admit job;
:Create hidden target generation G1;
:Arm source CDC retention;
:Choose snapshot HybridTime S;
note right
  Current prototype has no final fence.
  Writers must be quiesced externally
  from F selection through finalize.
end note
fork
  :Clone / transform source state at S;
fork again
  :Capture source commits after S;
end fork
:Replay changes into G1;
:Wait until replay lag is small;
:Acquire brief distributed write fence;
:Choose final barrier F;
:Drain final changes through F;
:Atomically activate G1 for logical table L;
:Invalidate catalogs and release fence;
:Retain then garbage-collect G0;
stop
@enduml
